## Data sources

Weather data is retrieved from third-party services and is subject to their own
terms:

- [Buienradar](https://www.buienradar.nl/) — current conditions, station list,
  forecast, radar imagery.
- [Open-Meteo](https://open-meteo.com/) — hourly precipitation and UV index.
